WEBVTT

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:02.319
My name is Mohamed Abdi Gadiid.

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:04.920
I am the Head of Operations at

00:00:05.539 --> 00:00:07.279
A&A Trade Solutions.

00:00:07.899 --> 00:00:11.159
Today, I would like to give you a brief
overview

00:00:11.979 --> 00:00:16.899
of the services our company provides.
First of all, the company offers

00:00:16.899 --> 00:00:18.479
services known as

00:00:19.199 --> 00:00:24.579
procurement and logistics. We can also
help you source

00:00:24.579 --> 00:00:27.619
a wide range of different products

00:00:28.379 --> 00:00:32.299
that you may be interested in selling.
One of the opportunities we offer you

00:00:32.299 --> 00:00:32.680
as a customer

00:00:33.399 --> 00:00:34.000
is that we can

00:00:34.759 --> 00:00:37.199
connect your business directly

00:00:37.799 --> 00:00:42.639
with factories in China, as well as
suppliers and markets across China.

00:00:42.639 --> 00:00:46.639
Our service is an A-to-Z service
for our customers.

00:00:47.299 --> 00:00:49.419
We will find the products you need,

00:00:50.279 --> 00:00:55.399
purchase them for you, and deliver them to
you while you remain in your own country.

00:00:55.399 --> 00:01:01.979
Invest your time and money in the efficient
service provided by A&A

00:01:01.979 --> 00:01:06.839
Trade Solutions. Finally, business owners,
tell us what you are looking for,

00:01:07.639 --> 00:01:10.080
and leave it to us to find it for you.

00:01:11.639 --> 00:01:25.179
[Background music]
